{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "90b665f880eba58ef943a8ec859cec406c969a196804d9317681b1ecb6a1d8c7", "ja": "（39プロジェクトの始動に合わせて、\n千早の宣材写真も撮り直すことになった）", "zh": "（为了配合39PROJECT的开始，\n千早的宣传照也要重拍。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1001_p", "source_sha256": "fea24919fadae7b28cb82bf8b079ee80207f862a500d712b707b99465c93c1cb", "ja": "（撮影は滞りなく終了し、スタッフの評判も上々。\nこれも経験の成果かな）", "zh": "（拍摄工作顺利结束，工作人员也赞赏有加。\n或许这也是经验累积的成果吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "3db222b9f26723938a221d14c3405093fed40bff1874b55bd45dfa1229f80968", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n写真の印刷、終わったそうですね。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n听说照片已经印出来了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "01122e1c4e74fde9c5b0d02e751491b5fc2070d1211fbd66713da3e65b060853", "ja": "お疲れさま、千早。どの写真もばっちりだよ。\nどれを宣材に使おうか悩むくらいだ。", "zh": "辛苦了，千早。每张照片都很棒喔。\n都不晓得该拿哪张当宣传照了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "21ed750bdda5dc5266c27a840f206c3071910bdfcdbce097a43840e2a6b6af64", "ja": "そんな、いくらなんでも……。\nあの、見せてもらえますか？", "zh": "哪有这么夸张……\n请问，方便让我看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "00c72ecda53f1571731aa7980ad78523c9c73fabd56efebde3b8d85b32ec093b", "ja": "もちろん。\nほら、よく撮れてるだろ？", "zh": "当然。\n你看，是不是拍得很棒？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "dacf7df4d112f4a23dde7311417e55d15040a287f9c41fe18905a84d1ec4cd3e", "ja": "千早？", "zh": "千早？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "dfff435ec041c01c48c8aae470a305f31f4d225c2e01006bc26f2d88190bc134", "ja": "{$P$}。お言葉を返すようですが、\n本当にこれで……良かったんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，我这么说可能有点失礼，\n但这种照片……真的能用吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1c411232dcebe47ae3a514b378ef8ce42d7ebeca79a1a3a970d975d9d8566675", "ja": "えっ。千早は良くないと思うのか？", "zh": "咦？千早觉得不好看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "84ae3ae224b9d06367bb2b32e1fd92e3c49d9de8bbe0f47399c11145ad1341fd", "ja": "はい。アイドルの宣材写真としては、\n心もとないというか……。", "zh": "是的，我不是很有自信这些照片\n能拿来当偶像的宣传照……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "675dd4bb8b997a20ea839d1f140b1f0caece8a9e72690f2aa8b8a48ec644ea3b", "ja": "自分で言うのも何ですが、笑顔が少ないです。\n全体にトーンも暗くて、こう……地味なのでは？", "zh": "虽然这话我自己说起来很怪，但照片的笑容太少了。\n整体的色调也偏暗，感觉……是不是不够亮眼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f167c374a2747033b2cb9ceafa006f611e3c0f91f0055894daa8927edba701ba", "ja": "そうかな？　静かに微笑んでいる感じが、\n千早らしくていいと思うけど。", "zh": "会吗？我倒是觉得这种静静的微笑，\n挺有千早的风格呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "8fa586102354b335069377ba93b450f64c35ef345274fb508267541d31904bba", "ja": "そ、そんな風に思ってくれるのは、きっと\n{$P$}だけです。私にはとても……。", "zh": "会、会这样想的人，肯定只有\n{$P$}而已。我实在不觉得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_1014", "source_sha256": "d4cd26d1529d407150da4df217309bcbd29427393a7b22b1957dd17ae4cbf0aa", "ja": "そんなことない", "zh": "没有这回事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "b66844adba19c477f378435192130ffa60eadd9d38c992f150464e590b4bdeb2", "ja": "そんなことないよ。そこまで客観的に自分の写真を\n見てる時点で、撮り直す価値があったと思うし。", "zh": "没有这回事，你能这么客观看待自己的照片，\n就表示重拍宣传照这件事有了它的意义。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2001_002chi", "source_sha256": "f7207809731f15b1f8fcf9960ee376c2dfe16acc3705640c692541f651d8c4a7", "ja": "価値……？　どういうことですか？", "zh": "意义……？请问这是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2002_p", "source_sha256": "21c71044f0d8863d41a8692e80ceb4a029f247614690c5922ac5427d9d1d3a24", "ja": "今の千早を撮れて良かったってこと。\nデビューした時に撮った宣材写真を覚えてるか？", "zh": "意思就是幸好有把现在的千早拍下来。\n你还记得自己刚出道时拍的宣传照吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2003_002chi", "source_sha256": "597a725a8cbe12931a2f3527bcda77cba893a397361d87ff704f1fb5bbebaf10", "ja": "いえ、かなり前に撮ったので、あまり……。", "zh": "不记得了，时间过于久远，实在没什么印象……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2004_p", "source_sha256": "73d9dd957669cc5033a5b9fc1bd43fd3b3991a5b1d0bb0ab5ae7df5fe4fc1bff", "ja": "えっと、確か鞄の中に……あった。\nほら、これなんだ。", "zh": "我找找，我记得有放在包包里……找到了。\n来，就是这张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2005_002chi", "source_sha256": "19699928216f2f8f7e861ac9d5ebd6f30a7b181fd09ab1d2b74ce480ad9db5fb", "ja": "これは……！", "zh": "这是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2006_p", "source_sha256": "3a27757d0b8326a1e80a1bf60cb4c7c3cc8baee10032925bb2097d4c71da1ce4", "ja": "正直、ぎこちないよな？", "zh": "说真的，看上去很僵硬对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2007_002chi", "source_sha256": "6851e2da834efb0d13eb365106e7aaaef7c63126374633ac4d1af9d38e56a986", "ja": "ぎこちないというか、表情がありません。\n何も見ていないような目をして……ひどい……！", "zh": "与其说是僵硬，应该说是毫无表情。\n眼神失焦……太惨了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2008_p", "source_sha256": "b471c7b5438d53f67ffaddfb44fdaac5540afb268ed3a1b726b28ee4a566a2d7", "ja": "い、いや、そこまでとは思わないけど。", "zh": "我、我觉得也没你说的这么夸张啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2009_002chi", "source_sha256": "bce9d16ce914c362959f2275fc650cce483f03b9b3ada2f7c9314970e670fbfd", "ja": "いいえ、これはそこまでの有様……。\n自分でもあきれました。", "zh": "不，这张照片就是这么糟糕……\n连我自己看了都摇头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2010_002chi", "source_sha256": "31a60ae37a38a5d1e131d8b8609f8a625a7d91189a642171456a55955f38ceab", "ja": "こんな写真を、色々な方に見られていたなんて……。\nくっ！", "zh": "我居然让那么多人看到这种照片……\n呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2011_p", "source_sha256": "bd3fbd6b6e001eb492743da757a5d016d40690e618456f0fb845744b61141d39", "ja": "ま、いいじゃないか。そう思えるってことは、\nそれだけ成長したってことだよ。", "zh": "这样也没什么不好呀？既然你会这么想，\n那就代表你有了相当的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2012_002chi", "source_sha256": "fee052fea5ec0f69154abe19c75b936ec948b1df82caffbb0b37ab77f0e096cc", "ja": "そう……ですね。\n成長と言っていいのか、少し悩みますけれど。ふふっ。", "zh": "说得……也对。\n虽然我有点烦恼这是否能称为成长就是了，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2013_002chi", "source_sha256": "8a7d7aa17e5dc277b7cfb36eeed10b1515f596d4a9ad58f50c3e62b7e9c88a55", "ja": "でも、よくわかりました。確かに、今の自分の\n位置を確認するには、いい写真だと思います。", "zh": "不过，我明白你的意思了。以重新审视\n自身定位的角度而言，这些照片确实相当不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2014_002chi", "source_sha256": "b8714b0dc28c6f3413cbb78b0938930eeacaa222117dd4377d9bc0abc1a74a27", "ja": "{$P$}。あの……ありがとうござい\nました。これからも、よろしくお願いしますね。", "zh": "{$P$}，那个……真的很谢谢你。\n今后也要请你多多指教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2015_p", "source_sha256": "f6f3b54d6fc1a8247ea5261d87d374d904b7f02b056c6cb96f98f2e2494827dd", "ja": "はは、こちらこそ。", "zh": "哈哈，彼此彼此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2016_002chi", "source_sha256": "d5c3d3e8c1547d3d90b3e8ee3fcbc3e4ef552c1c2aa9974b138dcd6c979320e0", "ja": "では、帰りの支度をしてきます。あ、宣材写真の\n差し替えもお願いしますね。……一刻も早く。", "zh": "那么，我去收拾东西准备回去。啊，\n更换宣传照的事也麻烦你了……可以的话越快越好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2017_p", "source_sha256": "8837ae54c23cf448325f0dd19963517c6d713755a5d962b24536783aa7449b04", "ja": "（デビュー当時に比べて、千早の表情には色が出て\nきた。けど、もっと色々な顔が眠っているはずだ）", "zh": "（跟刚出道那时比起来，千早现在的表情更有温度。\n不过，她应该还有许多表情尚未展现出来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_002_2018_p", "source_sha256": "c39f094839692df4422e0645ef23426acb63e9d07f4ff9e106b61709ec3671ec", "ja": "（いつかまた、撮り直すとしよう。\n新しい千早を、みんなに見てもらうために）", "zh": "（哪一天再来重拍吧，\n为了让大家看见全新的千早。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
